# Phase 5 transcript research: a cancelled turn. Escape twice over streamed
# prose (the turn's own cancelled line), the next turn answered, then Escape
# twice over a running `sleep 30` (the call's cancelled row in its group).
# The cancelled marker is the change (c29d5bfc: U+25A0 -> U+25AA). Ctrl-O shows
# both cancelled entries. Each product runs its own shell tool (fx's `shell`,
# xfx's `terminal`) in its no-questions mode, as p5-toolstop-retint does.
fx: gateway p5-transcript-cancel-turns.json
xfx: gateway p5-transcript-cancel-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
# The full-access warning is up from the first frame for 4 s on both
# (capfile.py TIMERS): the turn starts once it has come and gone, so no snap
# below races it.
until shown Full access
wait 4
until gone Full access
type stream please
wait 1
key Enter
held
wait 1
snap mid
key Escape
wait 0.3
key Escape
wait 2
snap esc
release
type next
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 3
snap next
type run the long one
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 3
snap cmd-running
key Escape
wait 0.3
key Escape
wait 2.5
snap cmd-esc
snapfull end
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key C-o
wait 1
gwlog
